---
/*
  Real brand SVG inlined so GSAP can target each letter path individually:
  - Draw-in on load: staggered opacity + translateY per path (filled logo)
  - Sticky shrink on scroll via ScrollTrigger (logo-animation.ts)
  - Color theming: override --logo-fill from parent to change color per section

  To change the logo color: set --logo-fill on .logo-wrapper in Layout.astro.
*/
